      "value": "<div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p> 你具有毒素伤害抗性，并免疫于疾病。你为防止陷入麻痹或中毒所做的豁免具有优势。你不需要吃、喝、呼吸。</p></div><p>You have resistance to poison damage and immunity to disease, and you have advantage on saving throws against being &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed] or &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]. You don't need to eat, drink, or breathe.</p>",
